 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server picks the language from the request's
+`Accept-Language` header: the listed `ko` or `en` with the highest q-value
+(region tags such as `ko-KR` count, `q=0` means not wanted, ties go to the one
+listed first). If the header is missing or names neither, it answers in
+`LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
